# Environment variables — .env is intentionally tracked (see .env for why:
# it only holds public Supabase URL/publishable-key values that the Lovable
# build pipeline reads directly from this file). Only *.local variants,
# which are meant for real secrets, are ignored.
.env.local
.env.*.local

